    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Must";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Discriminator has a duty to comply with the requirement or condition if it does not disadvantage persons with the disability.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(c) the failure to make reasonable adjustments has, or is likely to have, the effect of disadvantaging persons with the disability;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The discriminator must comply with the requirement or condition if it does not disadvantage persons with the disability.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
