    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Between";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Discriminator's failure to make reasonable adjustments occurs between the time they require or propose to require the aggrieved person to comply with a requirement or condition and the time the aggrieved person would be able to comply.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) the discriminator requires, or proposes to require, the aggrieved person to comply with a requirement or condition;";
