    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The person with the disability neither produces evidence that the animal is an assistance animal nor produces evidence that the animal is trained to meet standards of hygiene and behaviour.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The request for evidence must occur until the specified conditions are met.";
